BT /F2 10.5 Tf 0.18 0.49 0.20 rg 54 300 Td (Q1: Why did you choose Flutter over React Native or Native development?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 285 Td (> **Answer:** Flutter compiles directly to native ARM machine code using the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 272 Td (Impeller/Skia engine, eliminating the JavaScript bridge bottleneck. This ensures) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 259 Td (consistent 60+ FPS animations during heavy Google Maps telematics and camera) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 246 Td (barcode scanning. Crucially, Flutter allowed our team to maintain a single unified) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 233 Td (codebase that runs seamlessly as an Android APK and a Progressive Web App \(PWA\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 220 Td (with zero code duplication.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 0.18 0.49 0.20 rg 54 193 Td (Q2: How does the system protect farmer funds and prevent buyer fraud?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 178 Td (> **Answer:** We implemented a two-sided Escrow payment engine. When a buyer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 165 Td (orders, funds are deposited into a secure escrow account managed via Cloud) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 152 Td (Firestore security rules. Payment is never released immediately. Only after the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 139 Td (transporter delivers the goods, the buyer scans the tamper-evident batch QR code,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 126 Td (and photographic Proof-of-Delivery is submitted, the escrow unlocks and credits) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 113 Td (the farmer within seconds.) Tj ET
